{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update 04/22: The\u00a0portrait of new character Eve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/1e6f9a58f0bcf984205dcf0f9e089a2a.avif?t=1771460828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras_big/1e6f9a58f0bcf984205dcf0f9e089a2a.avif?t=1771460828 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update 03/14: New character portrait of Sally.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/81cf7bd3a1ec6a9c21629bfc103548fb.avif?t=1771460828\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update 03/06: Completed the save system and added character portrait and other art resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/3205147ff1867306ca033aba967c2bcb.avif?t=1771460828\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/927741b5c95be0ad84bc800f501ab157.avif?t=1771460828\" width=245 height=366 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/fec0962013361ac70a9cf96533d7fa07.avif?t=1771460828\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make the characters \u201cactive\u201d!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/1969266700be6950bad5d57175fa4ed3.poster.avif?t=1771460828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/1969266700be6950bad5d57175fa4ed3.webm?t=1771460828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update 2025/02/06: Updated all art assets. Turned the original skimpy animation into a stop-motion presentation similar to Dark Dungeon that make the skill shows with visual impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed the initial translation of the English text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >December 27 Update: Complete Event system, Shop system, Artifact system, upgrade and talent system. However, the art assets have not been completed, so the game screenshot style is different, please give us some time to update. ^_^</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >December 9 Update: Completed battle scene art. Complete the function of generating random maps and changing skill card groups.  ^_^</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's art assets are constantly being updated, so if you are interested in the game modes, please don't let the sketchy graphics of the game's screenshots put you off this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below are the art assets made by my game artist, and I will be catching up on replacing the assets he has already delivered to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/1f684fd13e5ec7a6eea7f39c29a24ae2.avif?t=1771460828\" width=177 height=318 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/90340fef01fa7c84717832bd4240a86f.avif?t=1771460828\" width=83 height=139 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/868bdb65d7fec6bc8ab1e648313e56ad.avif?t=1771460828\" width=171 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/b15c20bb7f9143ed24916c8734a76f83.avif?t=1771460828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras_big/b15c20bb7f9143ed24916c8734a76f83.avif?t=1771460828 width=800 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You have received a quest to explore a dungeon, so defeat all the enemies on your way and reach the deepest part of the dungeon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Etaine: Magic Link Dungeon is a <strong>new type</strong> deck-building game that combines Match3 and Roguelike to give birth to a <strong>special mechanic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Link\uff01Link\uff01Link\uff01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linking energy is how you fight</strong>, and this is a special deck-building game.Combat is no longer just about playing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like to unleash your favorite skills in a row? No problem, this game doesn't require you to draw cards. Set up your skill deck area, and just link the required lines in the energy zones, and you'll be able to use the skills you want all the time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not satisfied with the distribution of energy gems in the energy zone? You have regular skills that can change the distribution of energy gems, and good use of them lets you link as many as you want. ^_^</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No one can stop you if you open your mind and think! Use your wits to defeat all enemies!!!!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362090?t=1771460828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362090?t=1771460828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/e83560967851f344986bce90662c2776294cdbb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771460828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/e83560967851f344986bce90662c2776294cdbb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771460828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Excellent Card Picture Appreciation</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/3fc645bdee7976f9c4f25ea5192c0fd3.avif?t=1771460828\" width=618 height=844 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/4042a9c30f217a09ce75d99fe4b8aedf.avif?t=1771460828\" width=624 height=838 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/de9069685e92198f91fb3a2638dab55d.avif?t=1771460828\" width=628 height=838 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/a1ba22942a66f140ebb26c500dcf8131.avif?t=1771460828\" width=624 height=838 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362090/extras/048183292a18c25e81b8d74b5b989883.avif?t=177